    "NOFA 32",
    "The Los Angeles County Development Authority (LACDA) released Notice of Funding Availability Round 32 (NOFA 32), which will award Affordable Housing Trust Funds in capital funding, Section 8 Project-Based Vouchers (PBVs), and Project-Based Veterans Affairs Supportive Housing (PBVASH) Vouchers for the creation and operation of eligible permanent affordable multifamily rental housing units.",
